    "Content": "<p>The preview version of Web Apps on Linux now supports Ruby. Check out our <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/app-service-web/app-service-linux-using-ruby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">document </a>that walks you through the creation of your Ruby app.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/cd9905b7-a415-4d24-bfea-93981d129d06.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"docker\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/4878743a-caf1-441d-991a-8efc9af767d7.jpg\" title=\"docker\"></a></p>\r\n",
